  "description": "Hachimi.ai (哈基米道长) is an app for studying Chinese folk fate arts, with a cat Daoist inside. Cast Mei Hua Yi Shu hexagrams, build Zi Wei Dou Shu and Ba Zi charts on your phone, and keep each person as a case with every hexagram cast for them. For fun and company only, never prediction.",
